            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### New

- **Dashboard** opens your Nuvio dashboard right inside the app, with your saved
  passwords and AutoFill, so you can manage profiles and addons without leaving.
  When you close it, your changes are applied automatically.
- **Refresh** now brings in everything changed elsewhere: profiles, your list
  and the home shelves, not just the shelves.
]]></description>
